{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17147","headline":"赋得白云起封中 · 李正辞","name":"赋得白云起封中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年泰山顶，云起汉皇封。\n不作奇峯状，宁分触石容。\n爲霖虽易得，表圣自难逢。\n冉冉排空上，依依叠影重。\n素光非曳练，灵贶是从龙。\n岂学无心出，东西任所从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李正辞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}